{
  "type": "View",
  "id": "spec_texts_files_root",
  "orientation": "vertical",
  "width": "matchParent",
  "height": "matchParent",
  "background": "surface_muted",
  "child": [
    {
      "data": [
        {
          "name": "nextReadLinks",
          "class": "CollectionDataSource"
        },
        {
          "name": "onNavigateSpec",
          "class": "() -> Void"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Scroll",
      "id": "spec_texts_files_scroll",
      "width": "matchParent",
      "weight": 1,
      "child": [
        {
          "type": "View",
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "id": "spec_texts_files_header",
          "style": "page_header",
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "width": "wrapContent",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "semibold",
              "fontColor": "#64748B",
              "tapBackground": "#F3F4F6",
              "onClick": "@{onNavigateSpec}",
              "text": "breadcrumb"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 16,
              "fontSize": 36,
              "fontWeight": "bold",
              "fontColor": "#0B1220",
              "text": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 16,
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontColor": "#475467",
              "text": "lead"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 12,
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontColor": "#64748B",
              "text": "read_time"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "View",
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "id": "spec_texts_files_body",
          "width": "matchParent",
          "height": "wrapContent",
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_why",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_card",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_why_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_why_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_reference",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_muted",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_reference_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_reference_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "CodeBlock",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "topMargin": 16,
                  "code": "// app_contracts.spec.json — a prose field points into the texts file\n{\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"name\": \"app\",\n    \"description\": { \"md\": \"overview\" }                  // paired file: app_contracts.texts.yaml\n  },\n  \"unitContracts\": [\n    {\n      \"target\": \"UserRepository\",\n      \"cases\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"healthCheck_carriesATenSecondPerRequestTimeout\",\n          \"intent\": { \"md\": \"cases.user_repository.health_check_timeout\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"healthCheck_usesTheSharedClient\",\n          \"intent\": \"Short prose stays inline, as plain text.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    { \"md\": \"shared/network.texts.yaml#timeouts.default\" }   // a named file, relative to the spec\n  ]\n}",
                  "language": "jsonc",
                  "filename": "app_contracts.spec.json",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "copyable": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_yaml",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_card",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_yaml_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_yaml_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "CodeBlock",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "topMargin": 16,
                  "code": "# app_contracts.texts.yaml — beside app_contracts.spec.json\noverview: |\n  この面の app が所有し、単一の画面が所有しない unit target の契約。\n\n  ### ネットワーク層の規則\n  **(1)** 426: どの API 要求でも ForceUpdateManager を立てる。\n\n  **(2)** 401（/api/auth/* 以外）: refresh は 1 本にまとめる（single-flight）。\n\ncases:\n  user_repository:\n    health_check_timeout: |\n      **`[api.healthCheck=default]`** GET /api/health は要求単位で **10 秒**。\n\n      - iOS: `URLRequest.timeoutInterval == 10`\n      - Android: chain の connect / read / write timeout が 10 秒\n\n      > 実装前の状態: 両 OS 赤 — 2026-09-25 に実装済み",
                  "language": "yaml",
                  "filename": "app_contracts.texts.yaml",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "copyable": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_rendering",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_muted",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_rendering_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_rendering_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_rules",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_card",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_rules_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_rules_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "CodeBlock",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "topMargin": 16,
                  "code": "$ jsonui-doc validate spec app_contracts.spec.json      # measured, one fixture per line\n  [ERROR] texts: unitContracts[0].cases[0].intent: 'app_contracts.texts.yaml#cases.x' is not defined\n  [ERROR] texts: unitContracts[0].cases[1].intent: 'app_contracts.texts.yaml#cases' is a mapping, not a text — name one of its keys\n  [ERROR] texts: unitContracts[0].cases[2].intent: 'gone.texts.yaml#k' — gone.texts.yaml does not exist\n  [ERROR] texts: metadata.name: a text reference is read only in description / notes / intent\n  [ERROR] texts: app_contracts.texts.yaml: key True under 'cases' is a bool, not a string — YAML reads yes / no / on / off / true / false and bare numbers as values; quote the key if it is meant as a name\n  [ERROR] texts: app_contracts.texts.yaml: key 'cases.a.b' contains '.', which is the path separator — nest it as a mapping instead\n  [ERROR] texts: app_contracts.texts.yaml: line 5: duplicate key 'retries' (first at line 4) — YAML would keep only the last\n  [ERROR] texts: app_contracts.texts.yaml: 'cases.list' is a list — a value is a string (use `|` for Markdown) or a mapping of more keys\n  [WARNING] texts: app_contracts.texts.yaml: 1 key(s) no field of this spec references: cases.old",
                  "language": "bash",
                  "filename": "jsonui-doc validate spec",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "copyable": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_readers",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_muted",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_readers_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_readers_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "CodeBlock",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "topMargin": 16,
                  "code": "// read_spec_file (MCP) — each reference comes back with its text\n\"intent\": {\n  \"md\": \"cases.user_repository.health_check_timeout\",\n  \"text\": \"**`[api.healthCheck=default]`** GET /api/health は…\"\n}\n// \"text\" is for reading only. Edit the YAML file; validate refuses a\n// \"text\" key written back into the spec.",
                  "language": "jsonc",
                  "filename": "read_spec_file",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "copyable": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "id": "section_when_not",
              "style": "home_section",
              "background": "surface_card",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_heading",
                  "text": "section_when_not_heading",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Label",
                  "style": "section_subheading",
                  "text": "section_when_not_body",
                  "width": "matchParent"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "View",
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "id": "spec_texts_files_next",
          "style": "home_section",
          "background": "chrome_fill",
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "style": "section_heading",
              "text": "next_heading",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "fontColor": "chrome_ink"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "style": "section_subheading",
              "text": "next_subheading",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "fontColor": "chrome_ink"
            },
            {
              "type": "Collection",
              "id": "spec_texts_files_next_collection",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 24,
              "columnCount": 2,
              "lineSpacing": 16,
              "itemSpacing": 16,
              "lazy": "none",
              "scrollEnabled": false,
              "items": "@{nextReadLinks}",
              "cellIdProperty": "id",
              "sections": [
                {
                  "cell": "cells/next_step_card"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "View",
          "id": "spec_texts_files_footer",
          "width": "matchParent",
          "height": "wrapContent",
          "paddings": [
            24,
            32,
            32,
            32
          ],
          "background": "chrome_fill",
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontColor": "#94A3B8",
              "text": "footer_copyright"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
